            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 p-6 md:p-8 items-center">
                <div><h3 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white">Ready to Break <span class="text-teal-300">The Light Barrier?</span></h3><p class="text-gray-300 mt-3">Join 12k+ students and land your dream tech role. Scholarship test & career blueprint included.</p><ul class="mt-5 space-y-2"><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check text-teal-400"></i> 1:1 Mentorship with quantum experts</li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check text-teal-400"></i> Placement accelerator bootcamp</li><li class="flex gap-2"><i class="fa-regular fa-circle-check text-teal-400"></i> Lifetime access + community</li></ul></div>
                <div id="formSection" class="bg-black/40 backdrop-blur-md rounded-2xl p-6 border border-teal-500/50">
